{"slug":"public-benefit-report","main":"<div class=\"dYIffW_page\" data-page-top-spacer=\"condensed\"><section class=\"Bo9kyq_container _7W4LUq_section\" data-component=\"CSSGrid.Container\" id=\"mission\" aria-label=\"Our charter\"><div class=\"_7W4LUq_eyebrowBar\"><p class=\"tOQyXa_caption-1 tOQyXa_weight--bold EotmOW_root\" data-component=\"FeaturedEyebrow\">2026 Public Benefit Report</p></div><div class=\"_7W4LUq_statementBlock\"><h1 class=\"tOQyXa_headline-2--serif _7W4LUq_statement\" data-component=\"Headline\"><span class=\"tOQyXa_headline-2\" data-component=\"Headline\">Our charter</span> <!-- -->is to responsibly develop and maintain advanced AI for the long-term benefit of humanity.</h1></div><div class=\"Bo9kyq_standard _7W4LUq_introGrid\" data-component=\"CSSGrid.Standard\"><div class=\"Bo9kyq_m-full Bo9kyq_t-span-8 Bo9kyq_t-start-3 Bo9kyq_d-span-6 Bo9kyq_d-start-4 _7W4LUq_intro\" data-component=\"CSSGrid.Item\"><p class=\"tOQyXa_body-3 _7W4LUq_introText\" data-component=\"Body\">Anthropic is a Public Benefit Corporation (PBC), a designation that requires us to balance the financial interests of shareholders with the benefit to the broader public. Our Public Benefit Report takes stock of what we are doing to serve the public benefit, and of the work ahead.</p><a data-component=\"AnchorButton\" data-variant=\"primary\" class=\"f9ZZrG_button f9ZZrG_corner-small f9ZZrG_variant-primary f9ZZrG_size-medium f9ZZrG_icon-format-trailing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" href=\"/sites/anthropic/pages-assets/f367357e073e499ca43f.pdf\">Read our 2026 Public Benefit Report<span class=\"f9ZZrG_icon\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"currentColor\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"flex-shrink:0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16.5 13C16.7761 13 17 13.2239 17 13.5V15.5C17 16.3284 16.3284 17 15.5 17H4.5C3.67157 17 3 16.3284 3 15.5V13.5C3 13.2239 3.22386 13 3.5 13C3.77614 13 4 13.2239 4 13.5V15.5C4 15.7761 4.22386 16 4.5 16H15.5C15.7761 16 16 15.7761 16 15.5V13.5C16 13.2239 16.2239 13 16.5 13ZM10 3C10.2761 3 10.5 3.22386 10.5 3.5V12.1855L13.626 8.66797C13.8094 8.46166 14.1256 8.44275 14.332 8.62598C14.5383 8.80936 14.5573 9.12563 14.374 9.33203L10.374 13.832L10.2949 13.9033C10.21 13.9654 10.107 14 10 14C9.85718 14 9.72086 13.9388 9.62598 13.832L5.62598 9.33203L5.56738 9.25C5.45079 9.04872 5.48735 8.78653 5.66797 8.62598C5.84854 8.46567 6.1127 8.46039 6.29883 8.59961L6.37402 8.66797L9.5 12.1855V3.5C9.5 3.22386 9.72386 3 10 3Z\"></path></svg></span></a></div></div></section><section id=\"pillars\" aria-label=\"Charter pillars\"><div class=\"Bo9kyq_container _2w9DrG_heading\" data-component=\"CSSGrid.Container\"><div class=\"Bo9kyq_standard\" data-component=\"CSSGrid.Standard\"><div class=\"Bo9kyq_m-full Bo9kyq_t-span-8 Bo9kyq_t-start-3 Bo9kyq_d-span-6 Bo9kyq_d-start-4 _2w9DrG_column\" data-component=\"CSSGrid.Item\"><h2 class=\"tOQyXa_headline-3 _2w9DrG_title\" data-component=\"Headline\">Charter pillars</h2><p class=\"tOQyXa_body-3 _2w9DrG_intro\" data-component=\"Body\">Our charter pillars describe the conditions of a world where AI has gone well. Our work is built around them.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"Bo9kyq_container\" data-component=\"CSSGrid.Container\"><ul role=\"list\" class=\"MdMSIq_grid\"><li class=\"MdMSIq_cell\"><div class=\"MdMSIq_card\"><span class=\"tOQyXa_caption-1 MdMSIq_eyebrow\" data-component=\"Caption\">Pillar 1</span><span class=\"tOQyXa_headline-6 MdMSIq_title\" data-component=\"Headline\">The technical problems of AI safety are solved.</span><span class=\"tOQyXa_body-4 MdMSIq_summary\" data-component=\"Body\">Powerful AI can be developed and deployed without severe, irreversible harms.</span><button type=\"button\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-label=\"Read more about pillar 1\" data-component=\"Button\" data-variant=\"tertiary\" class=\"f9ZZrG_button f9ZZrG_corner-small f9ZZrG_variant-tertiary f9ZZrG_size-small f9ZZrG_icon-format-trai